<title>CANADA: PanCanadian, NOVA unit reach deal.</title>
<headline>PanCanadian, NOVA unit reach deal.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PanCanadian Petroleum Ltd and NOVA Corp unit NOVA Gas Transmission Ltd said they had reached an agreement on gas transmission tolls that should eliminate the need to construct the Palliser pipeline.</p>
<p>NOVA said it will establish a &quot;load-retention rate&quot; of C$0.155 per thousand cubic feet of gas transported on the NOVA system for eligible shippers who have executed a precedent agreement with Palliser Pipeline Inc as of December 12, 1996.</p>
<p>The proposed rate would increase two percent per year for a 20-year term.</p>
</text>
